urn your glass cannon Ice mage into a frosty tank? The choice is yours!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight An Eternal Fight</h2>At the end of the run, you\u2019ll take on an undefeatable, unbeatable, undominable boss. See how long you can survive and if your build has what it takes to finally take down the big bad boss.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Loot</h2>Find loot from over a BILLION different rune combinations, allowing new passive skills and bonuses to influence your run! With 6 rarities, and a forge system that allows you to upgrade and reroll specific aspects of your runes, you can create the perfect setup for your chosen build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930350/extras/39d334a859fad5bf9190b48caf448f44.avif?t=1770927848\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedurally Generated Maps</h2>Dodge a myriad of specialized enemy skills from fresh encounters that change from map to map. Staying true to the roguelike side of the game you will choose between randomized events on different worlds, randomized shrines with powerful boons that can change your run, and run-specific items to buy from merchants.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Gameplay</h2>Don't have a lot of time to spend on games? Or maybe you're just tired of 90 minute roguelike escapades. Don't worry. Each expedition into the corrupted worlds takes about 30 minutes. Still too busy? Just do one act and head back to base with your new loot.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >11 Difficulties</h2>As you loot and progress from one expedition to the next, you unlock new difficulties (up to 11 total). Higher difficulties not only make the expedition tougher, but they introduce new game mechanics to spice things up. Oh, and you get way better loot too!","developers":["RealmBreak Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"http